		{"id":"ce21dc04e4b2aefe","x":-336,"y":536,"width":466,"height":404,"type":"text","text":"# READ and WRITE\nRead and write one character from/to a file\nAfter each read operation, the index is moving forward\n\n``` pascal\n{ INPUT = 'ABC' }\nVAR\n\tCh: CHAR;\nWHILE NOT EOLN(INPUT)\nDO\n\tBEGIN\n\t\tREAD(INPUT, Ch);\n\t\tWRITE(Ch); \n\tEND;\n{ OUTPUT = 'ABC' }\n```"}
